        hotspot: { x: 130, y: 118, w: 22, h: 18 },
        look: `A single feather of beaten gold, so fine the torchlight shines through it. It should weigh more than a real feather. It does not. Kord breathes on it and it stirs.`,
        take: { text: `Kord lifts the feather off its pan. The beam swings, the pan rises, and with a soft and terrible patience the scale reaches up and puts the feather back. Firmly. Kord's fingers tingle for some time afterwards.`, sfx: 'servo' },
        hit: `Hitting a feather is like arguing with smoke. Kord does not try twice.`,
